Qt 6.11.2: report Vulkan finish failures before retirement/readback completion.

The failure is sticky: endFrame must not record a submitted or unsuccessfully
restarted command buffer, and later frames must not reuse its command pool.
The exported marker lets an adapter reject an unpatched runtime with the same
Qt version. This is a Qt dependency correction, not application map logic.

diff --git a/src/gui/rhi/qrhivulkan.cpp b/src/gui/rhi/qrhivulkan.cpp
